## 2. Architecture Frontend

Le frontend est structuré en composants React avec un état géré via React Hooks et des requêtes API via Axios/React Query.

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "Couche Frontend (Vite + React)"
        App[App.jsx - Point d'entrée] --> Router[React Router DOM]
        Router --> Layout[Main Layout / Sidebar / Header]
        
        Layout --> Pages
        
        subgraph "Pages"
            Pages --> Dash[Dashboard.jsx]
            Pages --> Auth[Login.jsx / Register.jsx]
            Pages --> Offers[OfferList / OfferForm]
            Pages --> Inv[InvoiceList / InvoiceForm]
        end
        
        Pages --> Components[Composants UI Réutilisables]
        Pages --> Context[Auth Context / State Management]
        Context --> Services[Services API Axios]
    end
    
    Services -.->|Fetch/Post Data| API[API Backend REST]

    %% Styles
    classDef react fill:#61dafb,stroke:#282c34,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef router fill:#ca4245,stroke:#282c34,stroke-width:2px,color:white;
    classDef api fill:#2ecc71,stroke:#27ae60,stroke-width:2px,color:white;
    
    class App,Pages,Components react;
    class Router router;
    class API api;
```

